{
  "name": "florence-shopper-pp-ranking-launch",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## florence-shopper-pp-ranking-launch\n\n**Skill:** /shopper-interrogator (Skill 3)\n**Trigger:** POST webhook with `x-florence-secret` header\n\nFires the second PP poll: \"Which of these concerns would most stop you from buying?\" Ranks the synthesised objections from #12.\n\n**Input shape:**\n```json\n{\n  \"asin\": \"B07XYZ4231\",\n  \"objections\": [\n    { \"rank\": 1, \"text\": \"Wheels look too thin to support a child\" },\n    { \"rank\": 2, \"text\": \"Sharp edges at the bottom\" }\n  ],\n  \"sample_size\": 100\n}\n```\n\n**Output shape:**\n```json\n{ \"poll_id\": \"abc456\", \"status\": \"launched\", \"expected_fill_minutes\": 15 }\n```\n\n**External dependency:** Product Pinion API. Uses `Florence — Product Pinion API` credential. Replace URL + body shape per Matt's API spec.\n\n**DEMO RISK:** This is the second PP wait. For workshop demo, pre-launch Wed/Thu and use `brain/demo/ranking-pre-poll.json` as cached input.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0a000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-160, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "florence/shopper/pp-ranking-launch",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0a000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "florence-shopper-pp-ranking-launch",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Florence — Webhook Secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_PINION_API_BASE/polls",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  type: 'ranked',\n  target_url: 'https://www.amazon.com/dp/' + $json.body.asin,\n  question: 'Which of these concerns would most stop you from buying?',\n  options: ($json.body.objections || []).map(o => o.text),\n  sample_size: $json.body.sample_size || 100\n}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "0a000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Launch PP Ranked Poll",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [540, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Florence — Product Pinion API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "poll-id",
              "name": "poll_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.id || $json.poll_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "launched",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fill-mins",
              "name": "expected_fill_minutes",
              "value": "={{ $json.expected_fill_minutes || 15 }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0a000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Shape Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [840, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0a000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [1140, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
